# A teacher's checks for the example "square a number" (File → Examples →
# Console input / output: emips/gui/examples/hello_input.asm) — three runs,
# three inputs (python3 -m emips check PROGRAM --checks squared.check)
run: seven
input: 7
check: output contains "squared = 49"
run: a negative number
input: -3
check: output contains "squared = 9"   (the square of a negative is positive)
run: zero
input: 0
check: output matches "^Enter a number: "    (it asks first)
check: output contains "squared = 0"
